<img loading="lazy" src="{{ 'images/developer-guide/about-platformos/trust-and-compliance-shield.png' | asset_url }}" alt="ISO 27001 and SOC 2 Type II certified badges" width="300" style="float: right; margin: 0 0 1rem 2rem; max-width: 40%;" />

We’re proud to share an important milestone in platformOS’s ongoing commitment to security and trust: **platformOS is now ISO 27001 certified and SOC 2 Type I and II certified.**

Our team has worked together to continuously strengthen the processes and controls that support the security of our platform and the way we operate.

ISO 27001 provides an internationally recognized framework for managing information security, while SOC 2 Type II is an on-going evaluation to ensure key controls are designed appropriately and operate effectively over time. Together, they provide independent audit, penetration testing and assurance that platformOS has robust processes and controls in place to manage information security, protect sensitive data, and operate responsibly.

platformOS has always kept security and enterprise scalability its priority from day 1.

Formalizing this milestone with recognized industry certification is important social proof for platformOS.

Security and compliance are a constant and deliberate commitment that the whole platformOS team has never wavered from. We will continue to maintain and improve the processes and controls that help us provide a secure and trusted platform for our customers and partners.

And to help our Channel Partners and clients who wish to gain official SOC 2 and/or ISO 27001 Certification for their own products built on platformOS, most of the hard work is done for you and the platformOS team can partner with your business to achieve your own formal certification.

{%- capture content -%}To learn more about our security and compliance program, certifications, and supporting documentation, visit the <a href="https://trust.platformos.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">platformOS Trust Center</a>.{%- endcapture -%}
